Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What we've done for almost thirty years?\NFind the value companies don't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And today, the biggest opportunity\Nis hiding in your day-to-day work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your teams are full of ideas for tools\Nthat would make them more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:21.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What they're missing is a way to\Nbuild them, quickly and easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That tool exists: it's DigiCraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The idea is very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You describe what you need,\Nin your own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And DigiCraft builds the app right\Nbefore your eyes: the screens, the data,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the calculations, the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:37.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One click, and your tool is live.\NOn desktop and on mobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:44.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}DigiCraft has already proven itself:\Nmore than 750 users, and 350 apps deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When it comes to security, your data stays\Nin Europe, access is fully under control,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and getting started is instant,\Nno training needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because it's your tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:55.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Truly yours.
